{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOS","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"約書亞記","commonName":"約書亞記","title":"約書亞記","order":6,"numberOfChapters":24,"sha256":"fb26417ceb168e7629022de9a02c144329d5b24a06f89f1b31937f655bc96a8f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":24,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOS/24.json","totalNumberOfVerses":654},"chapter":{"number":16,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["約瑟子孫分到的土地"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["約瑟的子孫抽籤所得的地方是從耶利哥附近的約旦河，就是耶利哥水泉的東面開始，穿過曠野，直到伯特利山區；"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["又從伯特利，即路斯，延至亞基人的疆土亞他綠，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["然後西下至押利提人的疆土，遠至下伯·和崙地區，經基色直到地中海。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["約瑟的兒子瑪拿西和以法蓮得了自己的產業。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["以下是以法蓮的子孫按宗族分到的土地：東面從亞他錄·亞達到上伯·和崙，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["直到地中海；北面從密米他向東繞到他納·示羅，到雅挪哈東部，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["再到亞他錄、拿拉，經耶利哥直到約旦河；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["又從他普亞往西到加拿河，直到地中海。這就是以法蓮的子孫按宗族所分的產業。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["此外，他們又從瑪拿西人的產業中，分到部分城邑及其附近的鄉村。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他們沒有趕走住在基色的迦南人，迦南人至今還住在以法蓮人當中，為他們服勞役。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOS/16.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOS/17.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOS/15.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}